"119410\" data-to_url=\"/api/aucegypt/catalog/32/course/62926/\"> ECON 3054  -  Environmental and Natural Resource Economics (3 cr.)</a> </li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#\" class=\"permalink\" data-permalink_id=\"63823\" data-legacy_id=\"1475\" data-signature=\"0f487b64c8ae791ed34fc71f8d53e948\" data-display_type=\"tooltip\" data-link_text=\" %title%\" data-anchor_text=\"\" data-from_id=\"21967\" data-from_type=\"core\" data-to_id=\"61235\" data-to_type=\"course\" data-show_title=\"1\" data-to_legacy_id=\"118026\" data-to_url=\"/api/aucegypt/catalog/32/course/61235/\"> ECON 3055  -  The Digital Economy: Artificial Intelligence, the Future of Work and Development (3 cr.)</a> </li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#\" class=\"permalink\" data-permalink_id=\"63818\" data-legacy_id=\"1820\" data-signature=\"ba16e7a09f3015a174280de5143aba3b\" data-display_type=\"tooltip\" data-link_text=\" %title%\" data-anchor_text=\"\" data-from_id=\"21967\" data-from_type=\"core\" data-to_id=\"63241\" data-to_type=\"course\" data-show_title=\"1\" data-to_legacy_id=\"119733\" data-to_url=\"/api/aucegypt/catalog/32/course/63241/\"> ECON 3099  -  Special Topics in Economics (3 cr.)</a> </li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#\" class=\"permalink\" data-permalink_id=\"63816\" data-legacy_id=\"1368\" data-signature=\"9a0f3f672f8e2ce6f4ea740d3d1f93b4\" data-display_type=\"tooltip\" data-link_text=\" %title%\" data-anchor_text=\"\" data-from_id=\"21967\" data-from_type=\"core\" data-to_id=\"61239\" data-to_type=\"course\" data-show_title=\"1\" data-to_legacy_id=\"118030\" data-to_url=\"/api/aucegypt/catalog/32/course/61239/\"> ECON 4012  -  Feasibility Study (3 cr.)</a> </li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#\" class=\"permalink\" data-permalink_id=\"63826\" data-legacy_id=\"1412\" data-signature=\"180b8eb86c28e9995f9350f68a522394\" data-display_type=\"tooltip\" data-link_text=\" %title%\" data-anchor_text=\"\" data-from_id=\"21967\" data-from_type=\"core\" data-to_id=\"62927\" data-to_type=\"course\" data-show_title=\"1\" data-to_legacy_id=\"119