ECON 4081  -  Econometrics (3 cr.)</a> and <a href=\"#\" class=\"permalink\" data-permalink_id=\"63811\" data-legacy_id=\"1370\" data-signature=\"e082f70ebdbdbfb39736bfbb41ccde27\" data-display_type=\"tooltip\" data-link_text=\" %title%\" data-anchor_text=\"\" data-from_id=\"21967\" data-from_type=\"core\" data-to_id=\"61243\" data-to_type=\"course\" data-show_title=\"1\" data-to_legacy_id=\"118034\" data-to_url=\"/api/aucegypt/catalog/32/course/61243/\"> ECON 4082  -  Practicum (1 cr.)</a> </li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#\" class=\"permalink\" data-permalink_id=\"63817\" data-legacy_id=\"734\" data-signature=\"88831089abe3c1c3ebdb172464b6dd09\" data-display_type=\"tooltip\" data-link_text=\" %title%\" data-anchor_text=\"\" data-from_id=\"21967\" data-from_type=\"core\" data-to_id=\"61238\" data-to_type=\"course\" data-show_title=\"1\" data-to_legacy_id=\"118029\" data-to_url=\"/api/aucegypt/catalog/32/course/61238/\"> ECON 4099  -  Seminar: Selected Topics in Economics (3 cr.)</a> </li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#\" class=\"permalink\" data-permalink_id=\"63822\" data-legacy_id=\"1479\" data-signature=\"b861a8d0443b99022c09e51b99527d9f\" data-display_type=\"tooltip\" data-link_text=\" %title%\" data-anchor_text=\"\" data-from_id=\"21967\" data-from_type=\"core\" data-to_id=\"61249\" data-to_type=\"course\" data-show_title=\"1\" data-to_legacy_id=\"118040\" data-to_url=\"/api/aucegypt/catalog/32/course/61249/\"> ECON 5254  -  Economic Growth & Development (3 cr.)</a> or <a href=\"#\" class=\"permalink\" data-permalink_id=\"63820\" data-legacy_id=\"1741\" data-signature=\"403a1621ade7d60301044906716534fa\" data-display_type=\"tooltip\" data-link_text=\"%title%\" data-anchor_text=\"\" data-from_id=\"21967\" data-from_type=\"core\" data-to_id=\"62504\" data-to_type=\"course\" data-show_title=\"1\" data-to_legacy_id=\"118961\" data-to_url=\"/api/aucegypt/catalog/32/course/62504/\">PPAD 5211  -  Qualitative Analysis for Policy and Administration (3 cr.)</a> </li>\n</ul>\n",
