   "description": "<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Students majoring in Economics who get accepted into the Combined BA and MA in Economics degree may take up to three graduate economics courses that would count towards both the BA and MA degrees.</p>\n\n<p><strong>CO-OP (3 cr.)</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Students majoring in Economics (B.A) who meet other relevant criteria are eligible to apply for the optional  <a href=\"#\" class=\"permalink\" data-permalink_id=\"63828\" data-legacy_id=\"1743\" data-signature=\"691a28b0d06974f93d8e19190224a4cf\" data-display_type=\"tooltip\" data-link_text=\" %title%\" data-anchor_text=\"\" data-from_id=\"21969\" data-from_type=\"core\" data-to_id=\"63175\" data-to_type=\"course\" data-show_title=\"1\" data-to_legacy_id=\"119667\" data-to_url=\"/api/aucegypt/catalog/32/course/63175/\"> BUSC 4000  -  Experiential Learning : CO-OP (3 cr.)</a> that counts towards their general electives. Selection is highly competitive, subject to limited capacity, and based on criteria set by the School of Business. Students enrolled in  <a href=\"#\" class=\"permalink\" data-permalink_id=\"63827\" data-legacy_id=\"1743\" data-signature=\"d788d37f3e0636cb9bc6856541d5c00c\" data-display_type=\"tooltip\" data-link_text=\" %prefix% %code%\" data-anchor_text=\"\" data-from_id=\"21969\" data-from_type=\"core\" data-to_id=\"63175\" data-to_type=\"course\" data-show_title=\"1\" data-to_legacy_id=\"119667\" data-to_url=\"/api/aucegypt/catalog/32/course/63175/\"> BUSC 4000</a> are only permitted to concurrently enroll in the seminar course <a href=\"#\" class=\"permalink\" data-permalink_id=\"63829\" data-legacy_id=\"1870\" data-signature=\"ab0296e3441243bca3f1b8c0cb04858d\" data-display_type=\"tooltip\" data-link_text=\" %title%\" data-anchor_text=\"\" data-from_id=\"21969\" data-from_type=\"core\" data-to_id=\"63316\" data-to_type=\"course\" data-show_title=\"1\" data-to_legacy_id=\"119810\" data-to_url=\"/api/aucegypt/catalog/32/course/63316/\"> BUSC 4001  -  Business 360 (3 cr.)</a> that counts towards their electives. Enrollment in this extra course is optional and subject to the approval of the CO-OP faculty mentor.</p>\n",
